===Alternative for levels 22–52: Iron darts===
[[File:Iron dart detail.png|left|frameless|width=71x71]]
Another low-level training method is to smith [[iron bar]]s into [[iron dart tip]]s, and fletch the tips into [[iron dart]]s. This can be a good way to train low-level [[Mining]], [[Smithing]], and Fletching at the same time, before faster methods for each skill are available. Darts have a hard limit of 10 sets made per tick, meaning that players can theoretically make up to 60,000 darts per hour; realistically, players can expect to make 3 sets of ten during a single game tick, resulting in 18,000 darts made per hour, or 1,800 sets of 10.
