=== Levels 55–99: Maple longbows ===
[[File:Maple longbow detail.png|left|frameless|width=57x57]]
[[Maple logs]] can be obtained for {{Coins|56.1}} each from [[Managing_Miscellania#Cost_of_materials|Miscellania]] and can then be fletched into [[Maple longbow (u)|Maple longbows (u)]] for about 100,000 experience per hour (about 150,000 experience per hour with [[Fletching knife]]). They can then be turned into [[maple longbow]]s for additional Fletching experience, although for ironmen this is not recommended. [[Bow string|Bow strings]] can be obtained quickly from tasks such as [[Temple Trekking]] or [[Money_making_guide/Killing_Zulrah|Killing Zulrah]] for [[flax]], at which point they can be spun with the [[Spin Flax]] spell with {{SCP|Magic|76|link=yes}} and access to the [[Lunar spellbook]]. These longbows can then be [[High Level Alchemy|high alched]] for {{Coins|384}} coins each.

===Levels 92+: Redwood shields===
[[File:Redwood shield detail.png|left|frameless|width=50x50]]
If the player has excess [[redwood logs]] from training [[Woodcutting]], they may choose to fletch them into [[Redwood shield|redwood shields]] at {{SCP|Fletching|92}}. Requiring two redwood logs, these provide 216 experience per shield made, or 108 experience per log. The experience rates are over 150,000 experience per hour, and require minimal attention.

==Other methods==
===Wintertodt===
''For more information, see [[Ironman Guide/Firemaking]].''[[File:Burning brazier (Wintertodt).png|left|frameless|width=54x54]]
Training [[Firemaking]] at [[Wintertodt]] can give some passive Fletching experience. Fletching a [[bruma root]] into [[bruma kindling]] give 0.6 times the player's Fletching level in experience, so the experience rates are heavily dependent on the player's current Fletching level. 

Each root will give between 0.6-59.4 experience, and players can fletch between 350-370 kindling per hour while actively playing. Players are not recommended to use this method as a primary training method at lower levels, and will benefit from reaching at least level 20 before joining.
